{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_01",
      "hash": "272f16ab9316fbdf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "菊子「我是四天王之一的菊子！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_05",
      "hash": "272f12ab9316f513",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說大木那老頭子\\n很疼[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_06",
      "hash": "272f13ab9316f6c6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "別看他現在是個老頭子，\\n他當年可是個實力強大的好男人！\\r\\n可惜現在已經不復當年勇啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_07",
      "hash": "272f14ab9316f879",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "做什麼寶可夢圖鑑，\\n在我看來只是個笑話！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_08",
      "hash": "272f1dab931707c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "寶可夢是為戰鬥而生的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_09",
      "hash": "272f1eab93170977",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]啊……！\\n就讓我來告訴[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\r\\n什麼是真正的戰鬥吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_kikuko_01_p02_cave_d1403",
      "hash": "530a6af515faf3f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_02",
      "hash": "272f17ab9316fd92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "菊子「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳贏了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的實力的確堅強，\\r\\n難怪會被大木那老頭看上！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_10",
      "hash": "27329bab931a13b5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我也沒有別的話好說了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳到下一個房間去吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_03",
      "hash": "272f18ab9316ff45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "菊子「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳來啦！\\c\\n我可沒理由每次都\\n像之前那樣輸給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\c\\n放馬過來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_04",
      "hash": "272f11ab9316f360",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "菊子「不愧是大木那老頭\\n看中的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_11",
      "hash": "27329aab931a1202",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳和[VAR TRNAME(0001)]\\n就跟過去的我們一樣，\\r\\n也是一對很不錯的勁敵嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_12",
      "hash": "273299ab931a104f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！\\n快到下一個房間去吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8120_max",
      "hash": "156e1c833bda91e6"
    }
  ]
}
